and into the WebAssembly engine the web app loads: about 500 crates from
crates.io under the licences deny.toml allows (Apache-2.0, BSD-2-Clause,
BSD-3-Clause, ISC, MIT, NCSA, Unicode-3.0, Unlicense, Zlib), most dual-licensed
