of its licence files are listed in THIRD-PARTY.md; their texts are in
THIRD-PARTY-LICENSES.txt. Copyright in each belongs to its authors as stated
there. Some crates compile in a bundled C library or data set under its own
licence, also reproduced there: Oniguruma (onig_sys, BSD-2-Clause), AWS-LC and
fiat-crypto (aws-lc-sys, ring), Adobe CMaps, Foxit fonts and JPEG 2000 data
(hayro-cmap, hayro-interpret, hayro-jpeg2000), Unicode tables (regex-syntax).
